---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="漁夫視角的海洋保育 | 首頁">
	<section id="hero" class="relative h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
		<div id="hero-bg" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 will-change-transform">
			<img 
				src="/marine-conservation/hero-ocean.jpg" 
				alt="Ocean Background" 
				class="w-full h-full object-cover scale-110"
			/>
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/60 via-slate-900/40 to-slate-900 scale-110"></div>
		</div>

		<div id="hero-rain" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-[5] overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div>

		<div id="hero-content" class="relative z-10 text-center px-6 will-change-transform">
			<h1 id="hero-title" class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-serif mb-6 opacity-0 translate-y-10">
				A Fisherman's Perspective
			</h1>
			<p id="hero-desc" class="text-blue-200 text-lg md:text-2xl max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed opacity-0 translate-y-10">
				海洋曾經養活了我的家人，但現在，<br>
				每一次撒網，我都在恐懼會撈起什麼...
			</p>
			<div id="hero-cta" class="mt-12 opacity-0 translate-y-10">
				<a href="/marine-conservation/story" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-10 py-4 rounded-full border border-white/35 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl text-white font-bold tracking-widest transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white/20 hover:border-white/60 hover:shadow-[0_12px_35px_rgba(148,163,184,0.35)]">
					
					進入漁夫的故事
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-white/30 text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase animate-bounce">
			Scroll Down
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="relative bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="sea-beam sea-beam-one"></div>
			<div class="sea-beam sea-beam-two"></div>
			<div class="sea-beam sea-beam-three"></div>
			<div class="sea-shimmer"></div>
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(2,6,23,0.08),rgba(2,6,23,0.2))]"></div>
		</div>
		<div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<p class="text-cyan-300/80 tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-xs md:text-sm">Ocean Reality</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif leading-tight">海面看似平靜，海底其實正在快速失衡</h2>
				<p class="mt-6 text-slate-300/85 leading-relaxed md:text-lg">
					塑膠微粒、過度捕撈與海水升溫，正在同時改變漁獲結構。很多老漁民說，近十年捕到的魚「越來越小、越來越少、越來越不穩定」。
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
				<article class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-200/15 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6">
					<p class="text-cyan-200 text-sm tracking-wide"># 01</p>
					<h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">近岸魚群減少</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-slate-300/90 leading-relaxed">沿岸魚種密度下降，漁船需要花更多油錢跑得更遠，作業時間也更長。</p>
				</article>
				<article class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-200/15 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6">
					<p class="text-cyan-200 text-sm tracking-wide"># 02</p>
					<h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">混獲與廢棄物增加</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-slate-300/90 leading-relaxed">漁網帶回更多非目標生物與塑膠垃圾，傷害生態也壓縮了漁民收益。</p>
				</article>
				<article class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-200/15 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-6">
					<p class="text-cyan-200 text-sm tracking-wide"># 03</p>
					<h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">生計不確定性上升</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-slate-300/90 leading-relaxed">漁季變短、魚價波動變大，讓年輕世代更難投入，也讓地方文化逐步流失。</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-900">
		<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-24 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] items-start">
			<div>
				<p class="text-sky-700 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-xs md:text-sm">What You Can Do</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif leading-tight">從今天開始，讓海洋恢復呼吸</h2>
				<p class="mt-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed md:text-lg">
					海洋保育不只是一個口號，而是每次選擇累積出來的結果。理解故事、參與行動、擴散影響力，都是改變的一部分。
				</p>
				<div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
					<a href="/marine-conservation/sdg" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-sky-700 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-sky-600 transition-colors">了解 SDG 14</a>
					<a href="/marine-conservation/news" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-slate-300 text-slate-800 font-semibold hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">查看最新新聞</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_25px_60px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)]">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-wide">本週行動清單</h3>
				<ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
					<li>減少一次性塑膠製品，尤其是吸管與餐具。</li>
					<li>支持永續漁業標章商品，讓市場反映生態價值。</li>
					<li>轉發可信新聞與資料，提升身邊人的海洋意識。</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<script>
	import '../scripts/index-hero.js';
</script>

<style is:global>
	#hero-rain {
		mix-blend-mode: screen;
	}

	#hero-rain .rain-drop {
		position: absolute;
		top: -24%;
		background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(186, 230, 253, 0), rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.85));
		border-radius: 999px;
		animation-name: rain-fall;
		animation-timing-function: linear;
		animation-iteration-count: infinite;
		will-change: transform, opacity;
	}

	@keyframes rain-fall {
		0% {
			transform: translate3d(0, -24vh, 0) skewX(-14deg);
			opacity: 0;
		}
		12% {
			opacity: 1;
		}
		100% {
			transform: translate3d(-26vw, 125vh, 0) skewX(-14deg);
			opacity: 0;
		}
	}

	.sea-beam {
		position: absolute;
		top: -18%;
		width: 22rem;
		height: 140%;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		filter: blur(18px);
		opacity: 0.92;
		mix-blend-mode: screen;
		will-change: transform, opacity;
	}

	.sea-beam-one {
		left: 6%;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(224, 242, 254, 0) 0%, rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.2) 18%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.55) 48%, rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.12) 78%, rgba(224, 242, 254, 0) 100%);
		transform: rotate(-18deg) translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale(1.1);
		animation: sea-beam-sweep-a 7.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
	}

	.sea-beam-two {
		left: 34%;
		width: 18rem;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(224, 242, 254, 0) 0%, rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.12) 16%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.64) 50%, rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.14) 78%, rgba(224, 242, 254, 0) 100%);
		transform: rotate(-8deg) translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale(1.25);
		animation: sea-beam-sweep-b 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
	}

	.sea-beam-three {
		right: 2%;
		width: 24rem;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(224, 242, 254, 0) 0%, rgba(165, 243, 252, 0.18) 16%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.52) 48%, rgba(165, 243, 252, 0.12) 80%, rgba(224, 242, 254, 0) 100%);
		transform: rotate(11deg) translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale(1.05);
		animation: sea-beam-sweep-c 8.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
	}

	.sea-shimmer {
		position: absolute;
		inset: -20%;
		background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(186, 230, 253, 0) 35%, rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.1) 44%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.36) 50%, rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.1) 56%, rgba(186, 230, 253, 0) 66%);
		filter: blur(24px);
		opacity: 0.8;
		mix-blend-mode: screen;
		animation: sea-shimmer-drift 6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
	}

	@keyframes sea-beam-sweep-a {
		0% {
			transform: rotate(-18deg) translate3d(-6vw, -10vh, 0) scale(1.1);
		}
		25% {
			transform: rotate(-14deg) translate3d(2vw, 6vh, 0) scale(1.15);
		}
		50% {
			transform: rotate(-20deg) translate3d(10vw, 14vh, 0) scale(1.22);
		}
		75% {
			transform: rotate(-13deg) translate3d(16vw, 8vh, 0) scale(1.18);
		}
		100% {
			transform: rotate(-17deg) translate3d(8vw, 18vh, 0) scale(1.26);
		}
	}

	@keyframes sea-beam-sweep-b {
		0% {
			transform: rotate(-8deg) translate3d(8vw, -8vh, 0) scale(1.16);
		}
		22% {
			transform: rotate(-2deg) translate3d(-2vw, 2vh, 0) scale(1.24);
		}
		55% {
			transform: rotate(-11deg) translate3d(-10vw, 14vh, 0) scale(1.28);
		}
		82% {
			transform: rotate(-4deg) translate3d(4vw, 10vh, 0) scale(1.18);
		}
		100% {
			transform: rotate(-9deg) translate3d(-6vw, 20vh, 0) scale(1.3);
		}
	}

	@keyframes sea-beam-sweep-c {
		0% {
			transform: rotate(11deg) translate3d(4vw, -10vh, 0) scale(1.04);
		}
		30% {
			transform: rotate(16deg) translate3d(-8vw, -4vh, 0) scale(1.1);
		}
		60% {
			transform: rotate(8deg) translate3d(12vw, 10vh, 0) scale(1.18);
		}
		85% {
			transform: rotate(18deg) translate3d(-2vw, 14vh, 0) scale(1.08);
		}
		100% {
			transform: rotate(12deg) translate3d(8vw, 18vh, 0) scale(1.2);
		}
	}

	@keyframes sea-shimmer-drift {
		0% {
			transform: translate3d(-18vw, -8vh, 0) rotate(-10deg);
		}
		33% {
			transform: translate3d(10vw, 2vh, 0) rotate(6deg);
		}
		66% {
			transform: translate3d(22vw, 8vh, 0) rotate(-4deg);
		}
		100% {
			transform: translate3d(2vw, 12vh, 0) rotate(8deg);
		}
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		#hero-rain {
			display: none;
		}

		.sea-beam,
		.sea-shimmer {
			animation: none;
		}
	}
</style>